<Legal title="Contact" description="How to reach FlutterProbe and Alpha Wave Systems." other="/contacto/">
  <h2>Support and billing</h2>
  <p>Questions about your account, a charge, a cancellation or the hosted services: <a href="mailto:support@alphawavesystems.com">support@alphawavesystems.com</a>. The <a href="/refunds/">refund and cancellation policy</a> says how to cancel.</p>

  <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
  <p>To access, correct or delete your personal data, or to object to its use, write to the same address. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> says what to include and when we answer.</p>

  <h2>Bugs and feature requests</h2>
  <p>For the command line tool and the agent, open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/AlphaWaveSystems/flutter-probe/issues">GitHub</a>. Do not put secrets or personal data in an issue: it is public.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>Please report a vulnerability privately to <a href="mailto:support@alphawavesystems.com">support@alphawavesystems.com</a> before publishing it, and include the version and the steps to reproduce it.</p>

  <h2>Company</h2>
  <p>Alpha Wave Systems S.A. de C.V. The <a href="/company/">company details</a> and the <a href="/terms/">terms of service</a> identify it in full.</p>
</Legal>
